WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Verification. Notice what changes and what stays the same.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:31.000
LEARNING TARGET: Pair targets with evidence

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:38.000
THE BIG IDEA: Verification asks whether a requirement was met; validation asks whether the chosen requirement and design satisfy the real need.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:45.000
WORKED EXAMPLE: A ruler can verify a stated width. It cannot validate whether that width serves the occupants.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:52.000
PAUSE AND PREDICT: Test-method matching

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:59.000
MODEL LIMIT: A system diagram is a model, not a finished vehicle or proof of roadworthiness.

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:06.000
TAKEAWAY: Pair targets with evidence
